<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-ESTIKO SHARE ISSUE REGISTERED.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-ESTIKO SHARE ISSUE REGISTERED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities board on April 9 registered the Estiko new share issue, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Estiko will issue 500,000 new shares between April 23 and May 8. The company's share capital will rise from its present 18 million kroons to 29 million kroons after the share issue, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The share price of a 10-kroon face value share is 40 kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
